<title>GREECE: GREEK CORE CPI INFLATION FIGURES JAN 96-MAR 97-BANK.</title>
<headline>GREEK CORE CPI INFLATION FIGURES JAN 96-MAR 97-BANK.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is Greece's headline</p>
<p>and core consumer price inflation figures for the period January</p>
<p>1996 to March 1997 provided by a foreign bank.</p>
<p>The Greek CPI index was revamped in early 1997 to mirror</p>
<p>recent consumption patterns. Headline inflation figures are</p>
<p>released monthly by Greece's National Statistics Service (NSS).</p>
<p>The NSS does not release core inflation figures but the</p>
<p>central bank and the national economy ministry are known to</p>
<p>monitor core inflation. Local banks acknowledge they do not</p>
<p>calculate core inflation rates.</p>
<p>Core or underlying inflation does not include volatile food</p>
<p>and energy prices.</p>
<p>		   Headline CPI inflation	 Core CPI inflation</p>
<p>			  (yr/yr, %)			 (yr/yr, %)</p>
<p>    Mar-97	    6.0				     7.5</p>
<p>    Feb-97	    6.6				     7.3</p>
<p>    Jan-97	    6.8				     7.1</p>
<p>    Dec-96	    7.3				     7.8</p>
<p>    Nov-96	    7.5				     7.9</p>
<p>    Oct-96	    8.0				     8.0</p>
<p>    Sep-96	    7.9				     7.8</p>
<p>    Aug-96	    8.0				     7.9</p>
<p>    Jul-96	    8.1				     8.1</p>
<p>    Jun-96	    8.4				     8.4</p>
<p>    May-96	    8.7				     8.7</p>
<p>    Apr-96	    8.8				     8.7</p>
<p>    Mar-96	    8.9				     8.8</p>
<p>    Feb-96	    8.4				     9.1</p>
<p>    Jan-96	    8.4				     9.2</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
